  "how_to_settle": "every raise returns exactly R per unit staked: outbid raises are refunded in full and the won locker has mean (R − outbid) ÷ (1 − outbid) × bid, solved per stage around the fixed RTP. Raise k (betType BID_k, amount = opening level × bids[k−1]): u < outbid[k−1] → OUTBID, win = round(bet × refund) (refund 1: the bid comes back); else v = (u − outbid[k−1]) / (1 − outbid[k−1]) and the locker pays the sloped band of v: win = round(bet × (payout + r·(2t − 1))), 0 in the empty band. The last stage has outbid 0: the rivals are gone and the locker always opens.",
